<title>BELGIUM: Belcofi H1 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Belcofi H1 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)	 752.9 vs 636.5</p>
<p>    Cons current				  371.3 vs 442.4</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains			   381.6 vs 194.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Holding company Belcofi NV, part of another Belgian holding company, Ackermans &amp; Van Haaren NV said results were exceptionally influenced by the fundamental change to the consolidation parameters following structural changes to the SNI/NIM group between Belcofi and AvH.</p>
</text>
